\p{
    Sources: [How to Prove False Statements](https://eprint.iacr.org/2025/118) (Khovratovich, Rothblum, Soukhanov, CRYPTO 2025); [Towards a White-Box Secure Fiat–Shamir Transformation](https://eprint.iacr.org/2025/329) (Arnon, Yogev, CRYPTO 2025); [A Fiat–Shamir Transformation From Duplex Sponges](https://eprint.iacr.org/2025/536) (Chiesa, Orrù, TCC 2025); [Weak Fiat–Shamir Attacks on Modern Proof Systems](https://eprint.iacr.org/2023/691) (Dao, Miller, Wright, Grubbs); [ArkLib](https://github.com/Verified-zkEVM/ArkLib) (\code{OracleReduction/FiatShamir}).
}
